//! The `animation-fill-mode` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets
//! how a CSS animation applies styles to its target before and after its execution.
//!
//! Initial: none. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: <single-animation-fill-mode>#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-animations-1/#propdef-animation-fill-mode
//!
//! Author guide:
